{"level":"info","message":"Code generated for: Create modern JavaScript/TypeScript-ready game architecture for a high-quality third-person 3D action RPG from this blueprint:\n{\"title\":\"Neon Rift Assault\",\"genre\":\"Action RPG\",\"camera\":\"3D\",\"artStyle\":\"Realistic cinematic with high contrast lighting\",\"targetPlatform\":\"PC, Console\",\"coreLoop\":\"Explore the environment, combat enemies, collect energy cores, avoid traps, progress to the next area.\",\"worldSummary\":\"A sprawling cyber city, alive with neon lights and perpetual rain, hosts the game's high-stakes rooftop battles. The player navigates this futuristic landscape, marked by moving holograms and the glow of neon signs, to thwart an enemy's dark designs.\",\"characters\":[{\"name\":\"Exo-Suit Commando\",\"role\":\"player\",\"description\":\"A highly skilled warrior equipped with an advanced exo-suit, capable of rapid dashes and wielding a plasma sword for close combat.\",\"personality\":\"Determined and resourceful, with a strong sense of justice.\",\"abilities\":[\"Dash\",\"Plasma Sword Strike\",\"Combo Finisher\"],\"visualPrompt\":\"Futuristic soldier in an advanced exo-suit, glowing plasma sword in hand, ready for combat.\",\"spriteStyle\":\"realistic\"},{\"name\":\"Drone Swarm\",\"role\":\"enemy\",\"description\":\"A swarm of agile, flying drones equipped with light laser weaponry, designed for quick strikes and surveillance.\",\"personality\":\"Aggressive and relentless.\",\"abilities\":[\"Laser Attack\",\"Swarm Tactic\"],\"visualPrompt\":\"A group of sleek, menacing drones, their bodies lit with neon accents, hovering in attack formation.\",\"spriteStyle\":\"realistic\"},{\"name\":\"Heavy Mech\",\"role\":\"enemy\",\"description\":\"A towering, heavily armored mech with powerful cannons and a shield barrier for defense.\",\"personality\":\"Imposing and unyielding.\",\"abilities\":[\"Cannon Blast\",\"Shield Defense\"],\"visualPrompt\":\"A massive mech unit, its armor gleaming under the neon lights, cannons aimed and ready.\",\"spriteStyle\":\"realistic\"},{\"name\":\"Mini-Boss Sentinel\",\"role\":\"boss\",\"description\":\"An elite combat unit with advanced weaponry and tactics, capable of controlling drones and deploying heavy attacks.\",\"personality\":\"Tactical and calculating.\",\"abilities\":[\"Drone Command\",\"Heavy Plasma Attack\",\"Tactical Retreat\"],\"visualPrompt\":\"A formidable figure in specialized armor, surrounded by drones, energy pulsing from its plasma weapon.\",\"spriteStyle\":\"realistic\"}],\"environments\":[{\"name\":\"Cyber City Rooftop\",\"description\":\"The game's battles take place on the rooftops of a futuristic city, with rain slick surfaces, neon signs, and moving holograms creating a visually rich setting.\",\"visualPrompt\":\"A vast cityscape at night, rain-drenched rooftops with neon signs and holograms casting vibrant glows.\",\"texturePrompt\":\"Wet surfaces reflecting neon lights, holographic advertisements flickering in the rain.\"}],\"gameplay\":{\"objective\":\"Defeat all enemies, collect 5 energy cores, and navigate through laser traps to progress.\",\"controls\":[\"Move\",\"Light Attack\",\"Heavy Attack\",\"Dodge\",\"Dash\",\"Combo Finisher\"],\"mechanics\":[\"Enemy lock-on\",\"Dynamic combat system\",\"Environmental interaction\",\"Energy core collection\"]},\"scenes\":[{\"name\":\"Rooftop Encounter\",\"purpose\":\"Main gameplay area where the player must defeat enemies, collect energy cores, and avoid traps.\",\"objects\":[{\"name\":\"Energy Core\",\"type\":\"item\",\"description\":\"A glowing energy source required to unlock new areas or upgrade abilities.\"},{\"name\":\"Laser Trap\",\"type\":\"obstacle\",\"description\":\"Deadly laser beams crisscrossing in patterns, requiring timing to safely navigate.\"}],\"winCondition\":\"Collect all energy cores and defeat all enemies.\",\"loseCondition\":\"Player health depletes to zero.\"}],\"audio\":{\"musicPrompt\":\"Futuristic synthwave tracks with a tense, driving beat for combat and exploration.\",\"sfx\":[{\"name\":\"Plasma Sword\",\"prompt\":\"A high-energy, buzzing slash followed by a sharp sizzle as it contacts enemy armor.\"},{\"name\":\"Mech Cannon\",\"prompt\":\"A deep, resonating boom as the cannon fires, followed by an explosive impact.\"}]},\"cameraSystem\":{\"mode\":\"third-person\",\"movement\":\"Dynamic follow with smooth transitions and soft lock-on for combat\",\"lockOn\":\"Soft lock-on targeting system for combat, allowing for fluid movement and attack execution\"},\"combatSystem\":{\"style\":\"Realistic cinematic combat with a focus on fluidity and impact\",\"playerMoves\":[\"Light Attack\",\"Heavy Attack\",\"Dodge\",\"Dash\",\"Combo Finisher\"],\"enemyArchetypes\":[\"Drone Swarm\",\"Heavy Mech\",\"Mini-Boss Sentinel\"],\"bossPhases\":[\"Initial Assault\",\"Drone Reinforcement\",\"Final Stand\"]},\"vfxPrompts\":[\"Neon light reflections on wet surfaces\",\"Plasma sword energy trails\",\"Explosions from heavy attacks and environmental hazards\"],\"animationNotes\":[\"Exo-suit agility and combat movements\",\"Drone swarm fluid, coordinated movements\",\"Heavy mech slow, impactful attacks\"],\"uiElements\":[\"Health and energy core HUD\",\"Dynamic enemy lock-on indicator\",\"Mission objectives tracker\"],\"codeTasks\":[\"Implement dynamic third-person camera system\",\"Create fluid combat mechanics with combo system\",\"Design environmental hazard system with laser traps\"]}\n\nInclude:\n- character state machine (idle/run/dodge/light-attack/heavy-attack/parry/hit/death)\n- lock-on targeting system\n- dynamic camera rig (combat, exploration, cinematic transitions)\n- stamina/health/combo combat loop\n- enemy AI behavior tree scaffolding\n- boss multi-phase hooks\n- animation event hooks and VFX trigger stubs\n- clean modular files (camera, combat, abilities, AI, UI, scene bootstrap)\n\nReturn production-ready starter code.","timestamp":"2026-02-26T05:49:33.896Z"}
